WEBVTT

00:06:58.956 --> 00:07:00.708
but you've worked through it

00:07:00.749 --> 00:07:04.795
and you've seen success
and happiness the other side?

00:07:05.629 --> 00:07:07.214
AK: The hardest thing ...

00:07:09.049 --> 00:07:14.180
when I started was not being able
to get the girl to speak.

00:07:16.140 --> 00:07:17.850
It was breaking my heart.

00:07:18.184 --> 00:07:19.351
"What is your name?"

00:07:19.393 --> 00:07:21.353
There's no answer, they look at you like.

00:07:22.688 --> 00:07:24.356
And I’m like, “Why?

00:07:25.608 --> 00:07:27.943
Why? Tell me what you need.

00:07:27.985 --> 00:07:29.528
I'm here to help.

00:07:29.987 --> 00:07:31.864
I'm not going to tell you what to do."